---
<BaseLayout title="Pusat Layanan Akademik" description="Direktori layanan akademik mandiri FAPERTA INSTIPER Yogyakarta: Permohonan KHS, Ujian Khusus, Nilai, dan Administrasi.">
  <!-- Banner Header -->
  <section class="grid-paper border-b border-[var(--line)]">
    <div class="container-shell py-12 sm:py-16">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--leaf)]/20 bg-[var(--leaf-soft)] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-[var(--leaf)]">
            <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)]"></span>
            Pelayanan Administrasi Terpadu FAPERTA
          </div>
          <h1 class="display-title mt-4 text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-[var(--leaf)] leading-tight">
            Layanan Akademik <br /><em class="font-extrabold text-[var(--gold)] not-italic underline decoration-[var(--leaf)] decoration-wavy decoration-from-font">Cepat & Terstruktur.</em>
          </h1>
          <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--ink)]">
            Satu pintu permohonan administrasi perkuliahan untuk mahasiswa dan dosen FAPERTA INSTIPER Yogyakarta. Bebas antrean fisik dengan sistem digital dan terverifikasi.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/layanan/permohonan-khs" class="btn-cta text-sm">
            ✦ Permohonan KHS Online (Poin 2) →
          </a>
          <a href="/layanan/cek-status" class="btn-secondary text-sm">
            🔍 Lacak Status Tiket
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Service: Bagian 2 (KHS Online) Spotlight Card -->
  <section class="container-shell -mt-6 sm:-mt-8 z-20 relative">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-[var(--leaf)] p-6 sm:p-9 text-white shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden border-2 border-[var(--gold)]/40">
      <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-[var(--leaf-dark)] opacity-40"></div>
      
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-8 relative z-10">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <span class="inline-block rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)] text-[var(--leaf)] font-black text-xs px-3 py-1">
              LAYANAN PRIORITAS ONLINE
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-white/80">Bagian 2</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="display-title mt-4 text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold !text-white leading-tight">
            Permohonan KHS Online (Semester 1 - 14)
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed !text-white/90">
            Kini Anda tidak perlu lagi datang langsung ke loket akademik hanya untuk meminta salinan lembar KHS atau transkrip nilai sementara. Ajukan secara mandiri, dapatkan nomor tiket pelacakan, dan berkas siap diproses oleh tim akademik.
          </p>
          
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-xs font-semibold !text-white/90">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2">
              <span class="text-[var(--gold)] font-bold">✔</span> Cakupan Fleksibel Semester 1 s/d 14
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2">
              <span class="text-[var(--gold)] font-bold">✔</span> Prasyarat Ujian Khusus & Aktif Kembali
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 rounded-xl px-3.5 py-2">
              <span class="text-[var(--gold)] font-bold">✔</span> Kode Tiket & Notifikasi Pelacakan
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="shrink-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-3">
          <a href="/layanan/permohonan-khs" class="btn-cta text-sm text-center">
            Buka Formulir KHS Online Sekarang →
          </a>
          <a href="/layanan/cek-status" class="rounded-full border-2 border-white/40 bg-white/10 px-6 py-3 text-center text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-white/20 transition">
            Cek Status Tiket Pengajuan
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Directory Grid (8 Layanan) -->
  <section class="container-shell py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4 border-b border-[var(--line)] pb-6">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Direktori Lengkap</p>
        <h2 class="section-title text-[var(--ink)]">8 Alur Layanan Akademik FAPERTA</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--muted)] max-w-sm">
        Pilih jenis layanan di bawah ini untuk melihat persyaratan berkas dan panduan pengajuan resminya.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {services.map((item) => (
        <div class={`rounded-3xl border ${item.isPrimary ? 'border-[var(--leaf)] bg-[var(--leaf-soft)]/30 ring-2 ring-[var(--leaf)]/20 shadow-md' : 'border-[var(--line)] bg-white shadow-xs hover:border-[var(--leaf)]'} p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-between transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1`}>
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
              <span class="font-black text-xs text-[var(--muted)] tracking-wider">
                POIN {item.number}
              </span>
              <span class={item.badgeClass}>
                <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-current"></span>
                {item.typeLabel}
              </span>
            </div>

            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-black text-[var(--leaf)]">
              {item.title}
            </h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-[var(--gold)] uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">
              {item.subtitle}
            </p>

            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted)]">
              {item.desc}
            </p>

            <!-- Alur 3 Langkah -->
            <div class="mt-5 border-t border-[var(--line)] pt-4">
              <p class="text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--leaf)] uppercase tracking-wider">Alur Proses:</p>
              <ol class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-[var(--ink)]">
                {item.steps.map((step, idx) => (
                  <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="grid h-4 w-4 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[var(--leaf-soft)] text-[10px] font-bold text-[var(--leaf)]">
                      {idx + 1}
                    </span>
                    <span>{step}</span>
                  </li>
                ))}
              </ol>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--line)]">
            <a 
              href={item.actionUrl} 
              class={`w-full text-center py-2.5 px-4 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold transition inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 ${item.isPrimary ? 'bg-[var(--leaf)] text-white hover:bg-[var(--leaf-dark)] shadow-sm' : 'bg-white border-2 border-[var(--leaf)]/20 text-[var(--leaf)] hover:bg-[var(--leaf-soft)]'}`}
            >
              <span>{item.actionLabel}</span>
              <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Bantuan Langsung Section -->
    <div class="mt-14 rounded-3xl bg-[#ecf3e8] border border-[var(--leaf)]/20 p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="max-w-xl">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-[var(--leaf)]">
          Butuh Bantuan Administrasi Khusus?
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--ink)] leading-relaxed">
          Jika layanan akademik yang Anda butuhkan belum tercantum atau mengalami kendala sinkronisasi data dengan SIAKAD, silakan hubungi tim Front Desk Bagian Akademik FAPERTA.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="shrink-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
        <a href="mailto:akademik@instiperjogja.ac.id" class="btn-secondary text-xs">
          ✉ Email: akademik@instiperjogja.ac.id
        </a>
        <a href="/faq" class="btn-cta text-xs">
          Baca Tanya Jawab (FAQ) →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
